          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Regular'>Analysis of more than 330,000 asteroids recorded by NASA.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Regular'>Focus: distance from Earth, relative velocity, and hazardous classification.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Regular'>The goal is to identify patterns in proximity, speed, and risk potential of Near-Earth Objects.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
